# Scacelith - Nederlands
# Translation of assets/i18n/en.lang (same keys, same {n}). Plurals: one|other.
# Register: informal "je/jij/jouw" everywhere (as Dutch Microsoft and Apple software), never "u".
# Buttons and menu items in sentence case (infinitive or noun); titles in capitals.
# Chess terms as the Dutch federation (KNSB) uses them, see the glossary of the Dutch coach files:
# zet, partij, remise, rokade, pat, notatieformulier, speeltempo; notation letters K D T L P.

